{"pattern_id":"pat-subscription-pages-mix-paygo-and-annual-terms","description":"Payments products often present both pay-as-you-go and subscription paths, requiring the pricing page to explain when each model is the better fit.","supporting_sources":["src-stripe-pricing-18","src-stripe-billing-18","src-stripe-pricing-table-18"],"transfer_conditions":["usage-based billing or payment processing"],"counterexamples":["single fixed-price products"],"failure_modes":["volume-floor confusion","subscription surprise"],"non_transferable_details":["exact rates and contract terms"],"rights_boundary":"evidence only"}
{"pattern_id":"pat-nonprofit-and-support-pages-close-the-loop","description":"Nonprofit and support pages often clarify whether a discount applies and how to choose the right license or contact path, which helps resolve ambiguity left by the main pricing page.","supporting_sources":["src-zoom-nonprofit-18","src-zoom-support-18","src-shopify-collective-18"],"transfer_conditions":["nonprofit discounts or license comparisons"],"counterexamples":["purely self-serve consumer plans"],"failure_modes":["eligibility confusion","license mismatch"],"non_transferable_details":["exact discount amounts"],"rights_boundary":"evidence only"}
{"pattern_id":"pat-enterprise-pricing-extends-into-admin-config","description":"Enterprise pricing frequently extends into admin configuration and seller-managed controls, so pricing pages and help pages jointly explain what can be configured versus negotiated.","supporting_sources":["src-shopify-pricing-18","src-shopify-plus-18","src-shopify-collective-18"],"transfer_conditions":["enterprise commerce or marketplaces"],"counterexamples":["simple consumer storefronts"],"failure_modes":["public access confusion","variable-fee surprise"],"non_transferable_details":["specific enterprise fee formulas"],"rights_boundary":"evidence only"}
